<title>USA: $341.2 mln out of muni funds latest week--AMG Data.</title>
<headline>$341.2 mln out of muni funds latest week--AMG Data.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>AMG Data Services said $341.2 million flowed out of municipal bond funds for the week ended April 9.</p>
<p>That represented a 0.18 percent decline in assets from the previous week, and led the four-week moving average to reflect outflows of $216.7 million, the highest since March 5.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
